2. The non-commissioned officer ranks shall be established in three grades and seven ranks:
(1) Senior non-commissioned officers: Sergeant Major Class 1, Sergeant Major Class 2, Sergeant Major Class 3;
(2) Intermediate non-commissioned officers: Sergeant First Class, Sergeant Second Class;
(3) Junior non-commissioned officers: Staff Sergeant, Corporal.
Among the non-commissioned officer ranks, Sergeant Major Class 1 shall be the highest rank and Corporal the lowest rank.
